Important practical reminders
For Experiments 19--23, create the file in the folder you are currently working in, then run the Docker command from that same folder.
For Java Experiments 21--23, the command compiles the .java file and then runs the class.
For Experiment 24, Kubernetes must be enabled and ready before checking nodes.
For Experiment 25, keep the kubectl port-forward command running while opening the browser.
For Experiments 27--28, Chrome and Node.js must be installed on the host computer.
